          "action": "Derive source_family_id from the family root, e.g. the master's uuid for both the master and its copies (\"family:<root uuid>\"), and keep virtual_copy_identity as the per-copy identity. Add a test with one master plus one virtual copy that asserts both rows share source_family_id."
        }
