        "reason": "The discovery manifest states its own grouping contract (split_policy): source_family_id must keep families intact across later splits. The implementation emits a value that differs between a master and its virtual copies, so the stated contract does not hold. The other reviewed CLI evaluators (cull score/baseline, personal train/evaluate, decision extract) matched their documented behaviour on the paths read.",
